WEBVTT

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:09.010
<i>Granzizel bilfen Gungnir zizzl.</i>

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:12.320
Impossible!

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.310
This waveform pattern...

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:17.810
It can't be...

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:26.250
Gungnir?

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.680
A black Gungnir...

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:24.450
<b>Ministry of Defense</b>

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:27.590
Undersecretary Shibata!

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:32.420
It looks like Japan isn't the only place 
those guys have been causing problems.

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:35.050
Well, this was a little while ago.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.050
There was also an incident

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:44.400
at an American relic-research institute.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:49.060
Not only did they lose all their research data,

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:53.060
they said the relic they had is missing, too.

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:56.690
And it has something to do with this?

00:02:57.370 --> 00:03:00.620
Seems kind of silly to assume it doesn't, right?

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.740
It's worth considering, at least.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:10.580
<b>Episode 2 
 Power and Lies in Her Heart</b>

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:07.750
We are the paramilitary organization Finé.

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:10.590
And we have demands for the entire world.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.590
Let me see...

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:16.590
We shall start by demanding that you 
turn your territory over to us.

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:18.360
Impossible.

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:24.350
If our demands are not met 
within twenty-four hours,

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:28.140
your nation's capitals will be paralyzed by Noise.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:31.850
That girl...

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:34.730
How serious is she?

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:37.160
I shall create a royal road

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:39.590
to lead us to paradise.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:41.990
Do you not think it wonderful?

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:44.470
Little brat...

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:47.240
Should we call you "President Idol" or something?

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:50.210
Turning over territory in twenty-four hours?

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:52.370
That's completely unrealistic!

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:54.800
We'll deal with this immediately.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:56.680
Okay, I'm counting on you.

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:05.760
I don't know the purpose of your deception...

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:07.970
You think I am deceiving you?

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:09.210
Yes.

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:11.510
The Gungnir Symphogear is not

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:14.480
for the likes of you to wield!

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:18.110
Imyuteus Ame no—

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:18.110
Wait, Tsubasa-san!

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:22.530
If you act now, the entire world will know

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.360
that Kazanari Tsubasa is a Symphogear-wielder.

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:26.490
But in this situation...

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.210
The songs of Kazanari Tsubasa

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:30.980
are meant for more than just combat.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:33.000
They're also songs to bring healing

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.450
and courage to those who've been hurt.

00:04:38.930 --> 00:04:40.640
Why not see

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:43.520
for yourself if I'm lying?

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:48.590
Then...

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:52.270
I am releasing the audience in the concert hall.

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:54.570
I shall not let the Noise hurt you.

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:56.520
Please leave at once.

00:04:57.410 --> 00:04:58.660
What are you trying to do?

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.530
What are you doing?

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.280
There was nothing in the plan about

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.410
sacrificing one of our advantages.

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.160
Will you explain?

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.620
I am the star of this show.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:15.160
And hostage-taking is not my style.

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:17.670
Do not fear being tainted with blood!

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:23.720
Shirabe and Kirika are on their way.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:27.480
Don't forget the goal of this mission, at least.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:28.600
Roger, Mom.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:30.050
Thank you.

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:33.430
You hear me?

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:38.190
<i>The terrorists calling themselves Finé</i>

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.190
<i>are demanding territory.</i>

00:05:40.760 --> 00:05:42.740
<i>With their power to control Noise,</i>

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:46.700
<i>they have a fair amount of leverage
 over the world's governments.</i>

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:48.300
<i>But...</i>

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:52.730
The hostages are being released.

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:54.830
Understood. The rest is...

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:56.490
Up to Tsubasa-san, yes?

00:05:56.490 --> 00:05:58.930
I'll handle that myself.

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:04.680
Hina?

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:08.840
If we stay here, we'll just make things worse.

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:12.560
Tachibana-san is late, too. 
But she's on her way.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:15.020
She never betrays your expectations!

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:17.470
You're right...

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:18.980
Okay.

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:27.250
<i>Hibiki, hurry and get here.</i>

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:34.400
Great!

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:37.120
So none of the audience was hurt!

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:42.120
We're investigating the aufwachen waveform 
we detected from the concert hall.

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:44.750
But it's unlikely to be a complete fake.

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:54.510
It doesn't seem like my Gungnir is gone.

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:58.270
Another striking spear...

00:06:58.860 --> 00:06:59.940
That was...

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.150
A black Gungnir...

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:09.400
<i>The whole world is watching 
Tsubasa-san right now.</i>

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:13.160
<i>I need to release her from 
the prison of those eyes.</i>

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.040
Oh, no! He's coming this way!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.460
It's all right, Kiri-chan.

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:24.880
If we have to...

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:30.020
Shirabe, don't you want to try 
and resolve this peacefully?

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:31.460
Is something wrong?

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:33.910
You need to evacuate!

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.930
Um, well...

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:38.420
Stare.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:40.660
She says she really needs to use the bathroom...

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:40.660
Stare.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:41.880
Stare.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.450
What a problem, huh?

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:49.440
Okay, when you're done, I'll lead 
you to the emergency exit.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.270
Don't worry!

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:53.420
She'll just take care of it right here.

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:54.450
It's fine!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:56.040
All right.

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:58.070
But be careful, okay?

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:00.730
Okay!

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:06.230
We got rid of him, I guess...

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:08.170
Stare.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.170
What is it?

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:14.180
I wouldn't go in a place like this.

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.630
I see...

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:20.900
Even if it's my job to protect you, Shirabe,

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:24.190
I won't last if it's this way everywhere we go!

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:27.690
Thanks for everything you do, Kiri-chan.

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:31.070
Okay, let's get going!

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:47.280
I'm jealous you have...

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:50.090
a place to call home.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:53.970
Maria, what are you...

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:56.470
The audience is gone!

00:08:56.850 --> 00:08:58.720
There will be no victims.

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:01.890
If you insist on not fighting anyway,

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:04.230
you'll do it simply to protect yourself.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:08.630
Is that all you care about?

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:31.640
As long as the cameras are broadcasting, 
Tsubasa-san can't use her Gear!

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:34.090
Hey, can't we go any faster?

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:36.340
We'll be there in ten minutes!

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:48.060
<i>Right, if I can get out of camera range...</i>

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:02.160
You won't be allowed to leave the stage yet.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.170
Don't you dare!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.840
Tsubasa-san!

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:18.940
<i>This is farewell to my life as diva.</i>

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:23.390
Tsubasa-san is going to give up her songs...

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:26.170
Listen to the song of a protector!

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:34.500
Why did it go black?!

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.150
Tsubasa-san! Tsubasa-san!

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:38.680
The broadcast from the concert 
hall's been turned off?

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:41.450
Which means...

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:42.200
Yeah.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:51.540
<i>Imyuteus Ame no Habakiri tron.</i>

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:26.790
<i>First blade. As fast as wind 
racing from a thunderbolt.</i>

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.530
<b>Azure Flash</b>

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:34.150
<i>Second blade. A state of emptiness, 
like a still forest...</i>

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:33.290
<b>Reverse Rasetsu</b>

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:36.550
The broadcast's been cut?

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:40.510
<i>If you fear monsters,</i>

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:43.730
<i>that is but a mirror held up to your own weakness.</i>

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:46.630
<i>If I don't do it, who will?</i>

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:52.240
<i>Awaken, invincible azure warrior that slays evil!</i>

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:51.680
As Kazanari Tsubasa's manager,

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:54.700
I can't let the world know she's a Symphogear-wielder

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:55.420
<i>Thousands, millions, billions of lives...</i>

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:58.570
if it would mean the end of her career as an artist.

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:58.570
<i>I'll hold them close, as I swing my blade.</i>

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:01.570
<i>A flash of destruction that 
makes your blood run cold.</i>

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:04.420
<i>Are you prepared to die?</i>

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:07.640
<i>Tonight, the crescent Moon hangs in the sky</i>

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:07.640
Tsubasa-san...

00:12:07.640 --> 00:12:10.830
<i>like a killing blade.</i>

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:19.680
<i>Now vanish beneath the flames of my blade!</i>

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:23.070
Here I come!

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.270
Her Gungnir is real?!

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:38.020
You've finally realized it.

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:41.040
Yes, this is my Gungnir.

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:45.030
An invincible spear that can pierce anyone!

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:53.580
That doesn't mean I will give up, though!

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:56.040
Maria, listen well.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:13:00.920
Her phonic gain is presently at twenty-two percent.

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:04.170
<i>She still has seventy-eight percent to go?</i>

00:13:08.590 --> 00:13:11.180
Don't look away when you're fighting me!

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:16.190
<i>Thousands, millions, billions of lives...</i>

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:19.390
<i>I'll hold them close, as I swing my blade.</i>

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:22.560
<i>A flash of destruction that 
makes your blood run cold.</i>

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:25.450
<b>Fuurin Kazan Shining Moon</b>

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:26.150
<i>Are you prepared to die?</i>

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:28.950
You can tell me what's going on in bed!

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:41.840
<i>I tilted my head and saw the love 
slipping through my fingers.</i>

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.710
<b>Type Alpha 100 Samsara</b>

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:47.720
<i>If I picked it up and piled it up, 
would it reach to the Moon?</i>

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:44.370
Here I go.

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.720
<b>K1LL JUL1ET</b>

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:53.720
<i>Realism mixed with errors, educating my DNA.</i>

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:59.980
<i>A monochrome prison in which 
I just bow my head like a doll.</i>

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:02.260
That was close.

00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:04.900
It sure was, yeah!

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:07.240
Three Symphogear-wielders?

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:09.740
Those are the girls I just saw!

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:12.920
Even if Shirabe and Kirika hadn't saved me,

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:16.370
you would not have been able to defeat me.

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:18.870
People like you always...

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:23.000
look down and miss your chance at victory.

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:24.380
Above us!

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:27.470
A rain of a billion bullets!

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:44.220
Let's not do this!

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:47.240
We just met! There's no reason for us to fight!

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:50.030
Those platitudes...

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:55.620
We can't believe someone who 
fights because of platitudes!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.740
That isn't...

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:58.560
If we talk, we can understand each other!

00:14:58.560 --> 00:14:59.740
We don't have to—

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:00.620
Hypocrite.

00:15:01.220 --> 00:15:05.060
There are too many hypocrites 
like you in the world.

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:12.190
<i>That's why I'm going to slice this world to pieces.</i>

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:13.890
What are you doing, Tachibana?

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:22.020
<i>To protect someone, I must believe 
that true strength is courage,</i>

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.770
You're too close!

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:25.580
<i>and dream of those tales.</i>

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:29.420
<i>I've almost forgotten that smile.</i>

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:32.620
<i>But it's okay, I can still fly.</i>

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:41.290
<i>I'll hold these shining bonds close, 
singing a melody!</i>

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:40.510
I just want to help people in trouble!

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:41.290
That's why...

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:43.040
That's what I mean by hypocrisy.

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:45.860
You don't know anything about pain.

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:48.340
I don't want to hear you say 
you're trying to help others!

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:50.550
<b>Type Gamma Svastika Firewheel</b>

00:15:55.910 --> 00:15:57.350
Snap out of it!

00:15:57.710 --> 00:15:58.850
Don't lose focus!

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:00.600
R-Right!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:07.480
The way these numbers are going up, 
we won't reach the necessary values.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:10.320
We'll use our last resort.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.210
What is that huge, goopy thing?

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.750
A multiplicative growth type.

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:27.960
No one said anything about using this!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:29.960
Mom...

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.800
All three of you, withdraw.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:34.970
Understood.

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:45.270
She wasn't using her Armed Gear?

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:56.820
Hey, you were the ones who summoned that Noise!

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:01.120
They're withdrawing now?

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:05.050
They're running away, just when 
it was starting to get good?

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:06.330
The Noise!

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:24.080
These things multiply and grow.

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:26.850
So if we don't stop them, 
they'll expand without limit?

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:29.730
Eventually, they'll spill out the top of the building!

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:32.250
Everyone, can you hear me?

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:36.590
The audience that just evacuated 
is still outside the concert hall.

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:39.070
We can't let that Noise escape.

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:40.360
The audience?

00:17:41.380 --> 00:17:42.330
Everyone...

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:44.400
If we aren't careful with our attacks,

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:47.330
they'll simply multiply in number.

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:49.240
What do we do?!

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:51.750
Our Climax Song.

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:54.060
We use our Climax Song!

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:56.840
That combination still isn't finished!

00:17:58.810 --> 00:18:02.290
We use a destructive force that overwhelms their 
ability to multiply and annihilates them?

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:06.020
It sounds like a plan Tachibana would 
come up with, but it makes sense.

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:08.030
Wait, are you serious?

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:18.370
Here we go.

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:20.530
<i>S2CA Tri-burst!</i>

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:31.080
<i>Gatrandis Babel ziggurat Edenal.</i>

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:38.870
<i>Emustolronzen Finé el Balal zizzl.</i>

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:47.770
<i>Gatrandis Babel ziggurat Edenal.</i>

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:57.570
<i>Emustolronzen Finé el zizzl.</i>

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:02.740
<i>Superb Song!</i>

00:19:03.390 --> 00:19:05.240
<i>Combination Arts!</i>

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:08.440
<i>Set Harmonics!</i>

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:18.720
Hang in there, Tachibana!

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:20.720
We're almost done!

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:27.510
The S2CA Tri-burst...

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:31.560
Hibiki-san tunes the Climax Songs 
of all three wielders,

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:34.000
turning them into a single harmony.

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:37.480
Only Hibiki-san, whose Armed Gear 
gains its special abilities

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:39.770
by holding hands, can do it.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:44.700
However, she bears the entire strain.

00:19:58.050 --> 00:19:59.010
Hibiki...

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:04.010
Now!

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:05.260
Ready...

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:29.040
Hit it!

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:31.410
This is our

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.460
Climax Song!

00:20:54.110 --> 00:20:56.310
What is that crazy thing?!

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:57.690
It's beautiful.

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:02.990
This monster is also our opponent...

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:14.120
The light of dawn.

00:21:17.530 --> 00:21:19.210
Those platitudes...

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:21.290
You don't know anything about pain.

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:23.590
I don't want to hear you say 
you're trying to help others!

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:25.840
Are you okay, Tachibana?

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:27.800
I'm fine...

